@TestAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5009

### 7-day forecast (default)
GET {{TestAPI_HostAddress}}/api/weatherforecast/Seattle
Accept: application/json

### 3-day forecast
GET {{TestAPI_HostAddress}}/api/weatherforecast/Paris?days=3
Accept: application/json

### 400: days out of range
GET {{TestAPI_HostAddress}}/api/weatherforecast/Tokyo?days=30
Accept: application/json

### 404: unknown city
GET {{TestAPI_HostAddress}}/api/weatherforecast/Xyzzyqq
Accept: application/json

###
